# Kani runs each wrapper on a real atomic, one thread (src/kani/atomic.rs).
# loom and C11 (verus/WEAKMEM.md): arena.rs writes a table entry only
# through `store` (and `Arenas::put_entry`'s write of the atomic `new`
# made), heap/tcaches.rs only through `store` and `swap` (and
# `Tcaches::put_entry`'s write of the atomic `new` made), no other file
# calls these wrappers, and this file mints one EntryPerm per atomic, in
# `new` (tests/loom/tests/access.rs). C++20's coherence rules
# ([intro.races]) give a load the permission's value at its place in the
# entry's modification order. The arena table's stores are made under
# the creation lock, which orders them; the `Release` store and an
# `Acquire` load that reads it publish the arena `build` wrote (a
# release/acquire pair, [atomics.order] p2). The narenas model checks
# that on copies of the `Arenas` steps (tests/loom/tests/pins.rs). The
# tcache table's writes, `Tcaches::create`'s `Release` store and
# `Tcaches::destroy`'s `AcqRel` swap, are made under the table lock,
# which orders them; `create`'s store and a `Tcaches::get` `Acquire`
# load that reads it publish the heap `Heap::create_detached` built (the
# same pair). `destroy`'s swap is a read-modify-write, which reads the
# last value before its own write, for every ordering ([atomics.order]
# p10). No loom model runs the tcache table's steps.
store	atomics primitive	loom/GenMC	trusted (partly checked, Kani: kani_proofs::atomic::entry_store, and loom: narenas::loom_narenas_create_publishes; not checked: this body under concurrency, which the model replaces with loom's `store` inside copies of the `Arenas` steps, in the configuration tests/loom/src/narenas.rs states, and the tcache table's store in `Tcaches::create`, which no model runs; the pointers' provenance (the harness compares addresses); the instances challoc uses, `T = Arena` and the tcache table's `T = u8` (checked at `T = u64`); the C11 argument above that the permission's value is the entry's last write, which tests/loom/tests/access.rs backs by matching source text only)
load	atomics primitive	loom/GenMC	trusted (partly checked, Kani: kani_proofs::atomic::entry_load, and loom: narenas::loom_narenas_create_publishes; not checked: this body under concurrency, which the model replaces with loom's `load` inside copies of the `Arenas` steps, in the configuration tests/loom/src/narenas.rs states, and the tcache table's load in `Tcaches::get`, which no model runs; the pointers' provenance (the harness compares addresses); the instances challoc uses, `T = Arena` and the tcache table's `T = u8` (checked at `T = u64`); the C11 argument above, which tests/loom/tests/access.rs backs by matching source text only)
# One atomic swap, as `core` documents; the permission carries the value.
swap	atomics primitive	loom/GenMC	trusted (partly checked, Kani: kani_proofs::atomic::entry_swap; not checked: this body under concurrency, which no loom model runs (its one caller is `Tcaches::destroy`); the pointers' provenance (the harness compares addresses); the instance challoc uses, the tcache table's `T = u8` (checked at `T = u64`); the C11 argument above that the permission's value is the entry's last write, which tests/loom/tests/access.rs backs by matching source text only)
